    {
      "text": "99 deed-restricted units plus 1 manager unit. Land donation tied to the 901 El Camino Real Gatekeeper office project.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001243",
        "SRC-001244"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CEQA Notice of Exemption: applicant Abode Communities (Jacqueline Figueroa, Associate Vice President); 99 below-market-rate units and 1 caretaker unit; APNs 053-343-110 and 053-343-080; exemption under CEQA Guidelines 15168, 15162, 15163 and 15183 relying on the General Plan Update EIR.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Redwood City Pulse: five stories, studios to three-bedroom units, 99 units for low- and very-low-income residents plus a manager unit; City Council approval was unanimous; land to be donated to Abode by El Camino Real Holdings JV as part of the 901 El Camino Real project.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY: ground-floor common areas below residential floors two through five; vehicle access on Shasta Street, main entry and courtyard on Buckeye Street.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Abode Communities lists Shasta Street Homes under Pipeline as a proposed, all-electric development.",
